  "ruleText": "Env-A 623.01 Applicability. The provisions of this part shall not apply to any revocation of a title V operating permit which is a result of a permit reopening pursuant to Env-A 609.19.\n\nSource. #1710, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; EXPIRED: 6-30-03\n\nNew. #8129, eff 7-28-04 (formerly Env-A 209.01); ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
